<title>UK: Ryland says ends talks on possible offer.</title>
<headline>Ryland says ends talks on possible offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British contract vehicle hire company Ryland Group Plc said on Thursday it had ended talks which could have led to an offer for the group.</p>
<p>Ryland said on January 10 it was in talks with an unnamed party about a possible takeover.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
